message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  Gyeongjin Kim and Yeongjin Jeon contributed equally; Hyukjin Kwon is
  the corresponding author. A preferred paper citation will be added
  after the manuscript receives a persistent identifier.
title: "Where to Adapt and What to Share: Federated LoRA for Aerial Object Detection"
type: software
authors:
