license: AGPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  Research code and reproducibility materials for an RT-DETR-L study of
  LoRA adapter placement and factor sharing in federated aerial-object
  detection under heterogeneous client label distributions.
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - low-rank adaptation
  - object detection
  - RT-DETR
  - aerial imagery
  - parameter-efficient fine-tuning
